 // Hakbal of the Surging Soul",manaCost:"",text:"",type:"Card",power:"-999",toughness:"-999",loyalty:"-999"},"keldon warcaller":{name:"Keldon Warcaller",manaCost:"{1}{R}",text:"Whenever this creature attacks, put a lore counter on target Saga you control.",type:"Creature — Human Warrior",power:"2",toughness:"2",loyalty:"-999"},"into the fray":{name:"Into the Fray",manaCost:"{R}",text:"Target creature attacks this turn if able.\nSplice onto Arcane {R} (As you cast an Arcane spell, you may reveal this card from your hand and pay its splice cost. If you do, add this card's effects to that spell.)",type:"Instant — Arcane",power:"-999",toughness:"-999",loyalty:"-999"},"benalish commander":{name:"Benalish Commander",manaCost:"{3}{W}",text:"Benalish Commander's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Soldiers you control.\nSuspend X—{X}{W}{W}. X can't be 0.\nWhenever a time counter is removed from this card while it's exiled, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token.",type:"Creature — Human Soldier",power:"*",toughness:"*",loyalty:"-999"},"tangled skyline":{name:"Tangled Skyline",manaCost:"{4}{G}",text:'When this enchantment enters, you gain 5 life and incubate 5. (Create an Incubator token with five +1/+1 counters on it and "{2}: Transform this token." It transforms into a 0/0 Phyrexian artifact creature.)\nPhyrexians you control have reach.',type:"Enchantment",power:"-999",toughness:"-999",loyalty:"-999"},"siani, eye of the storm":{name:"Siani, Eye of the Storm",manaCost:"{3}{U}",text:"Flying\nWhenever Siani attacks, scry X, where X is the number of attacking creatures with flying.\nPartner (You can have two commanders if both have partner.)",type:"Legendary Creature — Djinn Monk",power:"3",toughness:"2",loyalty:"-999"},"bloodspatter vampire":{name:"Bloodspatter Vampire",manaCost:"{1}{B}",text:'Flying\nIf an opponent would create a Clue, they create a Blood instead. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")',